Dear friends!
We present you a small roadmap about the upcoming update.
So, the screenshots first:

[IMG]http://jrex.srj-studio.com/images/191015/shot1.png[/IMG]
[IMG]http://jrex.srj-studio.com/images/191015/shot2.png[/IMG]
[IMG]http://jrex.srj-studio.com/images/191015/shot3.png[/IMG]
